    "regime_notes": "Admission gates are absolute daily IC >= 0.0070 and absolute daily ICIR >= 0.0840; both passed. Valid observations were concentrated in 2026-2028 because the aligned asset panel had sufficient history only there. 2026 IC/ICIR 0.035075/0.119835, 2027 0.031487/0.100093, 2028 YTD 0.023329/0.081827, recent 180-session proxy 0.025142/0.087889. Recent stability is marginal but remains above the full-sample ICIR gate; interpret small-universe uncertainty conservatively. At least 8 instruments were required per date.",
